      <h3>6.2 “Ship Small” Pattern</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Start with 1 role family or 1 team.</li>
        <li>Measure leading indicators in week 1.</li>
        <li>Ship iteration 2 quickly (template tweak, trigger tweak, doc fix).</li>
        <li>Scale only after impact is confirmed.</li>
      </ul>
