      <h2 class="section-title">7. Outputs &amp; Decision Logs</h2>

      <h3>7.1 Outputs</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Prioritized backlog of improvements with owners.</li>
        <li>Experiment briefs (hypothesis → plan → metrics).</li>
        <li>Decision logs (ship / iterate / rollback / decline).</li>
        <li>“What changed” release notes for trust and adoption.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>7.2 Decision Log Example</h3>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Decision</th>
              <th>Reason</th>
              <th>Evidence</th>
              <th>Next Step</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Ship</td>
              <td>Impact high, effort low</td>
              <td>2-week pilot improved time-to-schedule by 22%</td>
              <td>Roll out; monitor no-show rate</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Iterate</td>
              <td>Mixed results</td>
              <td>Improved SLA but complaints rose</td>
              <td>Adjust cadence; add override path</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Rollback</td>
              <td>Unintended harm</td>
              <td>Confusion signals increased</td>
              <td>Revert and redesign</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Decline</td>
              <td>Misaligned / risky</td>
              <td>Privacy concern</td>
              <td>Close with documented rationale</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
