<section class="chapter" id="implementation">
  <div class="panel panel--cool">
    <div class="chapter__inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">8. Implementation Notes</h2>

      <h3>8.1 Minimal Stack</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Backlog table (sheet / Airtable / simple DB).</li>
        <li>Standard intake form (structured fields).</li>
        <li>Weekly triage cadence + owner assignment.</li>
        <li>Metrics capture via Metrics A[i]gent (or existing BI).</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>8.2 Success Metrics</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Time from idea → decision.</li>
        <li>Experiment throughput per month.</li>
        <li>% shipped items with measured outcomes.</li>
        <li>Reduction in repeat friction themes (from Listening).</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="chapter" id="suite">
  <div class="panel panel--cool">
    <div class="chapter__inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">9. How This Fits in the A[i]gents Suite</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Listening A[i]gent</strong> identifies recurring friction and themes.</li>
        <li><strong>Innovation A[i]gent</strong> turns themes into tests and decisions.</li>
        <li><strong>Workflow A[i]gent</strong> executes changes in the system of work.</li>
        <li><strong>Metrics A[i]gent</strong> measures impact and guards against unintended outcomes.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Continuous improvement loop: listen → test → ship → measure.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="chapter" id="risks">
  <div class="panel panel--cool">
    <div class="chapter__inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">10. Risks &amp; Mitigations</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Risk:</strong> Innovation theater without shipping.<br><strong>Mitigation:</strong> decision logs + “what changed” notes required.</li>
        <li><strong>Risk:</strong> Experiments break trust or fairness.<br><strong>Mitigation:</strong> guardrails, review gates, human approval.</li>
        <li><strong>Risk:</strong> Measurement is disputed.<br><strong>Mitigation:</strong> shared definitions via Metrics Dictionary.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

